{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\SfxonItam\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-since-above-min",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Validator/CustomFieldDataValidator.php:355 OCP\\IContainer::get(): there since Nextcloud 34, the app declares from 32"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that the oldest majors of Nextcloud 32 to 33 do not have yet. Either min-version in appinfo/info.xml goes up, or the app does without it there.",
        "  lib/Validator/CustomFieldDataValidator.php:355 OCP\\IContainer::get(): there since Nextcloud 34, the app declares from 32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "frontend-url-without-route",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "src/services/CustomFieldGroupService.ts:43 /apps/sfxonitam/custom-field-group/search"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The frontend or a template builds 1 URL below /apps/sfxonitam/ that no route of the app matches. The request fails at run time.",
        "  src/services/CustomFieldGroupService.ts:43 /apps/sfxonitam/custom-field-group/search"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "migration-name-length",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version010100Date20260613074800.php:60 the primary key of sfxon_custom_field_group, named after the table: 24 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version010100Date20261023153100.php:199 the primary key of sfxon_transaction_document, named after the table: 26 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 32"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 names in the migrations are longer than the server allows, so it stops the install or the update of the app with an exception. The table names are counted with the default prefix oc_.",
        "  Up to Nextcloud 32 the server checks this only where info.xml lists no database, or lists oci among them.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version010100Date20260613074800.php:60 the primary key of sfxon_custom_field_group, named after the table: 24 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version010100Date20261023153100.php:199 the primary key of sfxon_transaction_document, named after the table: 26 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "migration-bool-notnull",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version010100Date20260613075200.php:71 sfxon_custom_field.editable, in Nextcloud 32"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 boolean column is NotNull. Oracle cannot store false in such a column, so the server stops the migration with an exception. A boolean column needs notnull false.",
        "  Up to Nextcloud 32 the server checks this only where info.xml lists no database, or lists oci among them. From Nextcloud 33 on the server makes the column nullable on Oracle itself.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version010100Date20260613075200.php:71 sfxon_custom_field.editable, in Nextcloud 32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Validator/CustomFieldDataValidator.php:17 OCP\\AppFramework\\IAppContainer: deprecated since Nextcloud 25"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 32 to 33. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Validator/CustomFieldDataValidator.php:17 OCP\\AppFramework\\IAppContainer: deprecated since Nextcloud 25"
      ]
    }
  ],
